# Build context allowlist for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore instead of the root
# .dockerignore). Keeps data, artifacts, run directories and virtualenvs out of the build context; models/ is
# only copied into the image by the optional `with-models` target.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!scripts/ops/
!scripts/research/realtime_backtest.py
!reports/ledgers/realtime_rl_policy.npz
!reports/ledgers/realtime_rl_policy.json
!models/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
src/*.egg-info
